  "text": "## Data Security  \n### Encryption  \n**In Transit:**\n- TLS 1.3 for all data transmission (web, mobile)\n- HTTPS enforced on all customer-facing systems\n- VPN for staff remote access  \n**At Rest:**\n- AES-256 encryption for databases\n- Encrypted backups (S3, off-site)\n- Encrypted file storage\n- Encrypted USB/portable devices",
